WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:07.173
No phones in class.

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:13.263
Where is everyone?

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:14.431
They stayed home.

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:16.558
Their parents are scared
of the giant monsters.

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:18.059
Mine aren't.

00:00:18.059 --> 00:00:21.938
My dad said it's a hoax to
burst the real estate balloon.

00:00:30.238 --> 00:00:31.114
All right.

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:33.074
Phones away.

00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:35.160
Chad's father is probably right.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:38.455
This has to be a
prank of some kind.

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:41.666
Everyone OK here?

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:42.459
Cate?

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:44.002
We're fine.

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:45.670
Today's lesson?

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:48.339
Don't believe everything
you see on the internet.

00:00:48.339 --> 00:00:50.425
We're monitoring
the situation closely.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:51.843
Make sure their
phones are charged

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:54.387
and they all know their
family reunification plans.

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:56.765
We'll let you know if we
decide to close the school.

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:03.688
Miss Randa?

00:01:03.688 --> 00:01:06.024
Are they coming here next?

